  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/94a3ba98fe537b71a0cedca8cdf679aea0668b950fa8b6ddc2ea6c6e99a6adff.png] \n\n1. 48 and 81\n\n(__**81 ÷ 3**__ + 6) ÷ 11 = 48 - 27 ÷ 3 × 5\n\n⇒ (__**27 + 6**__) ÷ 11 = 48 - 27 ÷ 3 × 5\n\n⇒ __**33 ÷ 11**__ = 48 - 27 ÷ 3 × 5\n\n⇒ 3 = 48 - __**27 ÷ 3**__ × 5\n\n⇒ 3 = 48 - __**9 × 5**__\n\n⇒ 3 = __**48 - 45**__\n\n⇒ 3 = 3\n\n \n\n2. 5 and 6\n\n(__**48 ÷ 3**__ + 5) ÷ 11 = 81 - 27 ÷ 3 × 6\n\n⇒ (__**16 + 5**__) ÷ 11 = 81 - 27 ÷ 3 × 6\n\n⇒__** 21 ÷ 11**__ = 81 - 27 ÷ 3 × 6\n\n⇒ 1.90 = 81 - __**27 ÷ 3**__ × 6\n\n⇒ 1.90 = 81 - **__9__**__** × 6**__\n\n⇒ 1.90 = 81 - 54\n\n⇒ 1.90 ≠ 27\n\n3. 81 and 27\n\n(__**48 ÷ 3**__ + 6) ÷ 11 = 27 - 81 ÷ 3 × 5\n\n⇒ (__**16 + 6**__) ÷ 11 = 27 - 81 ÷ 3 × 5\n\n⇒ __**22 ÷ 11**__ = 27 - 81 ÷ 3 × 5\n\n⇒ 2 = 27 - __**81 ÷ 3**__ × 5\n\n⇒ 2 = 27 - __**27 × 5**__\n\n⇒ 2 = 27 - 135\n\n⇒ 2 ≠ -108\n\n4. 11 and 5\n\n(__**48 ÷ 3**__ + 6) ÷ 5 = 81 - 27 ÷ 3 × 11\n\n⇒ (**__16 + 6__**) ÷ 5 = 81 - 27 ÷ 3 × 11\n\n⇒ __**22 ÷ 5**__ = 81 - 27 ÷ 3 × 11\n\n⇒ 4.4 = 81 - __**27 ÷ 3**__ × 11\n\n⇒ 4.4 = 81 - __**9 × 11**__\n\n⇒ 4.4 = 81 - 99\n\n⇒ 4.4 ≠ -18\n\nHence, ‘**48 and 81**’ is the correct answer.",
